# .gitignore for the published fork.
#
# The overlay replaces the upstream .gitignore deliberately. Upstream ignores
# CLAUDE.md at any depth, because upstream's copy holds private working
# instructions. The fork's CLAUDE.md is the opposite: it is the setup contract
# for whoever clones this repo and must ship.
#
# Without this file, `git add -A` in the sync's staging directory reads the
# synced upstream .gitignore, silently skips the root CLAUDE.md, and the fork
# publishes without any agent instructions — with no error anywhere.

.DS_Store
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.vercel

# Secrets. Never commit these; they belong in Vercel's environment settings.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
